NV Laboratory – license scope

Copyright (c) 2026 禅堂 Zendo (RevoluSound Team)

There is no single license that relicenses every program in this repository.

Original hub documentation and repository validation automation are covered by
licenses/HUB-MIT.txt. Copied third-party notices, original packaged documents,
screenshots of separately licensed software and third-party components retain
their existing terms.

Application-specific scope:
- NVIDIA-Profile-Inspector/LICENSE: the supplied MIT license of the fork.
- NVDriverForge/LICENSE: original binary distribution permission; private
  application-specific source rights reserved, third-party rights preserved.
- NVMFG-Unlock40/LICENSE: existing compiled-package sharing permission and
  separate third-party terms; not a blanket MIT license for NVIDIA SDK material.
- NVRasterPulse/LICENSE: the supplied MIT license of the application.
- THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and the LICENSES directories: component-specific terms.

No NVIDIA driver, NGX model/provider, Streamline runtime, RTSS binary or
NVCleanstall binary is relicensed or distributed by the hub documentation license.
Application source is not included. MIT itself does not require publication of
source, and this repository's private-source policy does not narrow MIT rights.

Français : il n'existe pas de licence globale remplaçant celles des logiciels.
Les documents originaux du hub et son outil de validation sont sous MIT.
Les conditions propres aux applications et aux composants tiers sont conservées
dans les fichiers ci-dessus. Les sources applicatives restent privées.
